# --- Datasets (large binary files, thousands of images) ---
# All datasets live in ./datasets and are kept out of git; store them separately
# (cloud/disk) or use Git LFS.
datasets/
# Legacy locations, in case a dataset is unpacked into the project root again.
Garbage Detection.v8i.yolov11/
Road-damage.v3i.yolo26/
Road-damage.v3i.yolov11/
*.zip
# To track a dataset in git anyway, remove the rules above and use Git LFS:
#   git lfs track "datasets/**/*.jpg" "datasets/**/*.txt"

